graph TB
    %% RAG检索系统架构 - Mermaid格式

    Query[用户查询] --> MQE

    subgraph RAGSystem["RAG检索系统"]
        subgraph Retriever["高级检索器 (AdvancedRetriever)"]
            MQE[多查询扩展<br/>MQE]
            HyDE[假设文档生成<br/>HyDE]
            Rerank[重排序优化<br/>Re-ranking]
        end

        subgraph DocProcessor["文档处理器 (DocumentProcessor)"]
            Parser[文档解析<br/>PDF/Markdown/Text]
            Multimodal[多模态处理<br/>文本/图像]
            Chunking[分块策略<br/>语义分块]
        end

        VectorSvc[向量存储服务<br/>VectorStoreService]

        MQE -->|多角度查询| HyDE
        HyDE -->|候选文档| Rerank
        Rerank -->|向量查询| VectorSvc

        Parser -->|解析结果| Chunking
        Multimodal -->|多模态提取| Chunking
        Chunking -->|文档分块| VectorSvc
    end

    subgraph DataLayer["数据层"]
        VectorDB[向量数据库<br/>Chroma]
        Files[知识库文件<br/>PDF/MD/TXT]
    end

    subgraph ModelLayer["模型服务层"]
        LLM[大语言模型<br/>通义千问]
        Embedding[嵌入模型<br/>DashScope]
    end

    Result[检索结果] -.-> ResultOut((最终输出))

    %% 数据流连接
    Rerank --> Result

    %% 外部服务连接
    HyDE -->|生成假设文档| LLM
    LLM -->|返回假设答案| HyDE

    HyDE -->|请求向量化| Embedding
    Embedding -->|返回向量| HyDE

    VectorSvc -->|存储/查询| VectorDB
    VectorDB -->|向量化| Embedding

    Chunking -->|嵌入| Embedding
    Embedding -->|返回向量| Chunking

    Files -->|文件加载| Parser

    %% 样式
    classDef inputStyle fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px
    classDef retrieverStyle fill:#d4e1f5,stroke:#5c6bc0,stroke-width:2px
    classDef docStyle fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef vectorStyle fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#5c6bc0,stroke-width:2px
    classDef dataStyle fill:#cfd8dc,stroke:#546e7a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef modelStyle fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#fbc02d,stroke-width:2px,dasharray: 5 5
    classDef outputStyle fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#27ae60,stroke-width:2px

    class Query inputStyle
    class MQE,HyDE,Rerank retrieverStyle
    class Parser,Multimodal,Chunking docStyle
    class VectorSvc vectorStyle
    class VectorDB,Files dataStyle
    class LLM,Embedding modelStyle
    class Result outputStyle

    %% 技术说明
    noteMQE[MQE (Multi-Query Extension)
    - 从多个角度重写查询
    - 提高检索召回率]

    noteHyDE[HyDE (Hypothetical Document Embeddings)
    - 生成假设答案
    - 基于语义而非字面匹配]

    noteRerank[Re-ranking
    - 评估文档相关性
    - 优化检索精度]

    noteMQE -.-> MQE
    noteHyDE -.-> HyDE
    noteRerank -.-> Rerank
